@page "/about"

<h3>About ExpenseCategorizer</h3>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <p>
            ExpenseCategorizer is a Blazor WebAssembly app built with Azure Functions, Cosmos DB, ML.NET, and OpenAI API.
            It demonstrates AI‑powered expense categorization with human‑in‑the‑loop correction.
            Receipts are parsed with OCR, amounts are extracted using rule‑based logic, and categories are predicted with ML.NET.
            Rows with uncertain amounts (like 0) are flagged for correction, ensuring accuracy and transparency.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

